# 🔥 Same Problem in All 3 Languages

Suppose we want to store:

```text
Student ID = 101
Student Name = Ravi
```

### C++

```cpp
pair<int, string> student = {101, "Ravi"};

cout << student.first << endl;
cout << student.second << endl;
```

### Java

```java
record Student(int id, String name) {}

Student student = new Student(101, "Ravi");

System.out.println(student.id());
System.out.println(student.name());
```

### Python

```python
student = (101, "Ravi")

print(student[0])
print(student[1])
```

